{"step_index":95,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:48:36Z","thinking":"Focusing on the resume template construction, two distinct rendering functions need definition. One targets a modern, visually polished design; the other prioritizes an ATS-friendly, semantic HTML structure for optimal parsing. The templates must be written now.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import { IResume } from './resume.model';\\n\\nconst escapeHtml = (str?: string): string => {\\n  if (!str) return '';\\n  return str\\n    .replace(/&/g, '&amp;')\\n    .replace(/</g, '&lt;')\\n    .replace(/>/g, '&gt;')\\n    .replace(/\\\"/g, '&quot;')\\n    .replace(/'/g, '&#039;');\\n};\\n\\nexport const renderModernProfessional = (resume: IResume): string => {\\n  const p = resume.personalInfo || ({} as any);\\n  return `<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <title>${escapeHtml(resume.title)} - Modern Professional Resume</title>\\n  <style>\\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: #1e293b; background: #fff; line-height: 1.5; padding: 40px; max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }\\n    header { border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\\n    h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }\\n    .contact-info { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #475569; }\\n    .contact-info a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }\\n    section { margin-bottom: 22px; }\\n    h2 { font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\\n    .summary-text { font-size: 13.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; }\\n    