{"step_index":103,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:49:38Z","thinking":"The consultant controller will implement endpoints for managing consultant data. It requires `getConsultants` for listing active consultants, supporting query parameters for filtering. There's a `getConsultantById` to retrieve a single consultant's information, and `getConsultantAvailability` will calculate available time slots, considering existing bookings. Finally, a `seedConsultants` endpoint will populate the database with initial demonstration data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import { Request, Response, NextFunction } from 'express';\\nimport { Consultant } from './consultant.model';\\nimport { Booking } from '../bookings/booking.model';\\nimport { NotFoundError, BadRequestError } from '../../utils/errors';\\n\\nexport const getConsultants = async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction): Promise<void> => {\\n  try {\\n    const { expertise, search } = req.query;\\n    const filter: Record<string, any> = { isActive: true };\\n\\n    if (expertise) {\\n      filter.expertise = { $in: [String(expertise)] };\\n    }\\n\\n    if (search) {\\n      filter.$or = [\\n        { name: { $regex: String(search), $options: 'i' } },\\n        { title: { $regex: String(search), $options: 'i' } },\\n        { bio: { $regex: String(search), $options: 'i' } }\\n      ];\\n    }\\n\\n    const consultants = await Consultant.find(filter).sort({ name: 1 });\\n\\n    res.status(200).json({\\n      success: true,\\n      data: { consultants }\\n    });\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    next(err);\\n  }\\n};\\n\\nexport const getConsultantById = async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction): Promise<void> => {\\n  try {\\n    const { id } = req.params;\\n    const consultant = await Consultant.findById(id);\\n    if (!consultant) {\\n      throw new NotFoundError('Consultant not found');\\n    }\\n\\n    res.status(200).json({\\n      success: true,\\n      data: { consultant }\\n    });\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    next(err);\\n  }\\n};\\n\\nexport const getConsultantAvailability = async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction): Promise<void> => {\\n  try {\\n    const { id } = req.params;\\n    const { date } = req.query; // Expects YYYY-MM-DD\\n\\n    if (!date || typeof date !== 'string') {\\n      throw new BadRequestError('Query parameter \\\"date\\\" (YYYY-MM-DD) is required');\\n    }\\n\\n    const consultant = await Consultant.findById(id);\\n    if (!consultant) {\\n      throw new NotFoundError('Consultant not found');\\n    }\\n\\n    // Parse target date\\n    const targetDate = new Date(`${date}T00:00:00.000Z`);\\n    if (isNaN(targetDate.getT\n<truncated 6146 bytes>","Description":"\"Create consultant listing, availability calculation, and seeding controllers\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\PRIYANKA\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\career-platform\\\\backend\\\\src\\\\modules\\\\consultants\\\\consultant.controller.ts\"","toolAction":"\"Writing backend/src/modules/consultants/consultant.controller.ts\"","toolSummary":"\"Create consultant.controller.ts\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
