{"step_index":111,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:50:20Z","thinking":"Developing the Booking Controller requires implementing several critical business rules. Firstly, past booking times must be rejected to prevent scheduling errors. Secondly, consultant validation is essential to ensure existence and active status. Booking duration calculations must also accurately determine the `endTime`. Finally, the controller will need to check and prevent overlapping bookings based on specific statuses.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import { Request, Response, NextFunction } from 'express';\\nimport { Types } from 'mongoose';\\nimport { Booking, BookingStatus } from './booking.model';\\nimport { Consultant } from '../consultants/consultant.model';\\nimport { BadRequestError, NotFoundError, UnauthorizedError, ForbiddenError, ConflictError } from '../../utils/errors';\\n\\nexport const createBooking = async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction): Promise<void> => {\\n  try {\\n    if (!req.user) throw new UnauthorizedError();\\n    const { consultantId, startTime, userName, userEmail, userPhone, agenda } = req.body;\\n\\n    const startDate = new Date(startTime);\\n    const now = new Date();\\n\\n    // 1. Reject bookings in the past\\n    if (startDate.getTime() <= now.getTime()) {\\n      throw new BadRequestError('Cannot book consultation appointments in the past');\\n    }\\n\\n    // 2. Validate consultant exists and is active\\n    const consultant = await Consultant.findById(consultantId);\\n    if (!consultant || !consultant.isActive) {\\n      throw new NotFoundError('Selected consultant is not available for bookings');\\n    }\\n\\n    const duration = consultant.durationMinutes || 45;\\n    const endDate = new Date(startDate.getTime() + duration * 60 * 1000);\\n\\n    // 3. Concurrency / Overlap check\\n    // Check if consultant has an active overlapping booking